    "description": "<p>An <strong>EcoDrop </strong>is a sustainable alternative to typical returns, powered by an innovative customer-to-customer network. This completely eliminates an entire shipping trip, a second set of packaging waste, and pounds of landfill waste.</p>\n<p>As a thank you for choosing the eco-conscious option, EcoDrop items are offered at a <strong>15% discount</strong> to show our appreciation for understanding that shipping may take slightly longer and packaging may not be in perfect condition. <a href=\"https://goodforsunday.com/pages/ecodrop\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Learn more about EcoDrop →</span></a></p>",
