    "handle": "save-the-ocean",
    "title": "Save the Ocean Collection",
    "collection_url": "https://goodforsunday.com/collections/save-the-ocean",
    "description": "<p>The importance of protecting our oceans can't be overstated. Eighty percent of all life inhabits the ocean, and the plants that support this delicate ecosystem produce over 70% of the air we breathe. Let's bring awareness to everyone on why saving the Ocean, means saving the Earth.</p>\n<p><em>$5 from every purchase will be donated to Sea Shepherd to defend, conserve, and protect our oceans.</em></p>",
